[{"title":"参玄歌","author":"释道川","text":"一尺水，一丈波，妙高峰顶笑呵呵。\n七步周行浑属我，不妨闲唱太平歌。\n灵利汉，不消多，法门广大遍周沙。\n若能当处分明了，只在如今一刹那。\n莫求真，休觅假，真假中间都放下。\n晃晃威光烁太虚，不知谁是知音者。\n赞不欣，徒说谤，三际无心俱扫荡。\n正体堂堂一物无，是佛是魔俱一棒。\n小根闻说暗攒眉，绳上生蛇又更疑。\n拨转面前关棙子，只许当人独自知。\n阿呵呵，在圆觉，流出菩提遍寥廓。\n鬼面神头几百般，无瑕镜里皆消却。\n君不见觌面相逢机掣电，直饶天眼不能观，点著不来真死汉。\n劝君参，参彻灵明自己禅。\n善财不用南方去，黑白分明在目前。\n劝君信，信心战退魔军阵。\n此是华严最上乘，森罗万象皆相应。\n劝君修，六门通达任优游。\n寒山拾得才相见，指点丰干哂未休。\n火风催，四山逼，那时要见君端的。\n有个真空解脱门，千眼大悲何处觅。\n有时放，有时收，唯有知音暗点头。\n杏华村里如相见，跳出沩山水牯牛。\n有时喜，有时嗔，无位真人迸面门。\n殷勤为说西来意，暮楼钟鼓月黄昏。\n有时唱，有时歌，颠言倒语不奈何。\n声声尽出娘生口，不属宫商一任他。\n有时默，不时笑，懵懂铁锤无孔窍。\n轻轻触著便无明，只这无明元是道。\n有时行，有时坐，露影藏身成两个。\n不独张现会打油，细观李四能推磨。\n无缝塔，见无因，巍巍本自隐深云。\n国师样子应难造，不觉锋棱露一层。\n无底钵，手中擎，百千沙界里头盛。\n大庾岭头提不起，都缘著力太多生。\n没底船，不曾漏，千重雪浪皆能透。\n只凭一个把稍人，谁管狂风连地吼。\n无鑐锁，孰安排，锁断重关绝往来。\n巨灵抬手空劳力，唯有无心便得开。\n无毫拂，是何物，击碎狐疑山鬼屈。\n一喝唯言三日聋，谁怜大辩翻成讷。\n无孔笛，最难吹，角徵宫商和不齐。\n有时品起无生曲，截断行云不敢飞。\n无根树，直侵云，枝条郁密盖乾坤。\n劫火洞然烧不得，利刀斩处亦无痕。\n无面目，担板汉，玩水游山无侣伴。\n迦叶门前倒刹竿，文殊剑上全身现。\n日面佛，乾屎橛，八两半斤谁辨别。\n七斤衫子恰相当，镇州休更秤萝卜。\n野鸭飞，鸾对舞，三个孩儿抱华鼓。\n赵老曾看半藏经，灵云一见桃华悟。\n真实语，报君知，不用思量不用疑。\n春来决定千华秀，冬尽长天片雪飞。\n头头漏泄真消息，那个休心辨端的。\n眼横鼻直一般般，不离当处休寻觅。\n古佛言，祖师说，千圣路头同一舌。\n他日人天匝地来，那时方表而今决。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20468,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其二十七","author":"释道川","text":"将杖探其水，方知水浅深。\n路遥知马力，岁久辨人心。\n子不孝，父不慈。\n恭而无礼，亲而有疏。\n不入惊人浪，难逢称意鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20469,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其二十六","author":"释道川","text":"问如绵里针，答似泥中刺。\n咆哮二虎吼生狞，各各利牙斤可怖。\n坐却碧峰头，截断当阳路。\n直饶擎出秘魔叉，路狭草深难进步。\n相见不相逢，回互不回互。\n四七二三眼相睹，云从龙兮风从虎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20470,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其二十五","author":"释道川","text":"丙丁童子来求火，再问炎炎燎面门。\n过现未来三世佛，不离其中转法轮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20471,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其二十三","author":"释道川","text":"师子咬人，狂狗逐块。\n三十里来方始悟，何似当初莫入去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20472,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其二十二","author":"释道川","text":"语不邪，笑不来。\n拙铺设，巧安排。\n猢狲将板拍，野老舞三台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20473,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其十九","author":"释道川","text":"现出虚空眼便花，更教打破事如麻。\n直饶指出当堂缝，分明鹞子过新罗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20474,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其十八","author":"释道川","text":"罚钱出院，众人皆见。\n有理难伸，风流满面。\n直饶兴化全提，未免令行一半。\n这一半，明眼衲僧点检看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20475,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其十六","author":"释道川","text":"避暑逃寒问是非，不离寒暑少人知。\n正中来也无回互，句里藏锋辨者稀。\n严天雪，火雪飞，风吹日炙杜阇黎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20476,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其十五","author":"释道川","text":"台山路，蓦直去，赵老见婆无别语。\n勘破回来知不知，莫信闲人说是非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20477,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其十三","author":"释道川","text":"三尺寒光射斗牛，镆铘提处鬼神愁。\n蛮夷不识军将令，误入重围血颈流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20478,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其十二","author":"释道川","text":"生死有无佛，虚名如电拂。\n俊鹞博天飞，不打篱边鹘。\n无欠无馀若太虚，不知谁解强名模。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20479,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其十一","author":"释道川","text":"他心三藏太颟顸，猢孙观了看划船。\n对面国师寻不见，祇为从来被眼谩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20480,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其十","author":"释道川","text":"水中捉月，镜里寻头。\n刻舟求剑，骑牛觅牛。\n空花阳焰，梦幻浮沤。\n一笔勾断，要休更休。\n巴歌杜酒村田乐，不风流处也风流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20481,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其九","author":"释道川","text":"三际求心心不见，两眼依然对两观。\n不须遗剑刻舟寻，雪月风华常见面。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20482,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其六","author":"释道川","text":"有相有求皆是妄，无形无相堕偏枯。\n堂堂密密何曾间，一道寒光烁太虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20483,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其五","author":"释道川","text":"七手八脚，神头鬼面。\n棒打不开，刀割不断。\n阎浮跳踯月千回，头头不离空王殿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20484,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十八首 其三","author":"释道川","text":"蝴蜂休恋旧时窼，五百郎君不奈何。\n欲火逼来无走路，痴心要上白牛车。\n门前羊鹿权为喻，室内啀喍总是讹。\n蓬㶿臭烟相恼处，出身不用动干戈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20485,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"释道川","text":"我有一条铁楖?，纵横妙用无人识。\n临行拨转上头关，轰起一声春霹雳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20486,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送南浦明公归日本","author":"释道东","text":"十幅蒲帆万里风，来无踪迹去还同。\n抬眸错认云山处，人在水天一色中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20487,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古八首 其八","author":"释道印","text":"踏破草鞋赤脚走，堂堂向外扬家丑。\n只知敛袂出人前，不觉衣穿露两肘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20488,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古八首 其三","author":"释道印","text":"握不成团拨不开，德云几度下崔嵬。\n有时行到海南岸，密密还从旧路回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20489,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古八首 其七","author":"释道印","text":"何必不必，方圆曲直。\n眉目分明，若为辨的。\n影草既随身，觌面当机疾。\n一双孤雁忽高飞，两只鸳鸯还独立。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20490,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古八首 其六","author":"释道印","text":"大鹏抟风，苍龙出海。\n手抬手搦，日上月下。\n霜雪严凝识岁寒，双陆盆边须喝采。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20491,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古八首 其五","author":"释道印","text":"接得与识得，谁复较锱铢。\n若问堂中事，堂中事转疏。\n只如云盖悟去，又作么苏噜苏噜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20492,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古八首 其四","author":"释道印","text":"推倒扶起，觌面千里。\n唯小释迦，风前按指。\n直饶海印发光，也是雪峰道底。\n遍界是文殊，遍界是慈氏。\n楼阁门开竟日闲，谁识善财童子。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20493,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古八首 其二","author":"释道印","text":"有伴即来，地辟天开。\n冷光重出匣，古路绝纤埃。\n万象森罗齐合掌，须弥岌崿舞三台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20494,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古八首 其一","author":"释道印","text":"霹雳未收声，闪电不留影。\n三更月到窗，半夜驴觑井。\n快骑骏马骤高楼，一尘不动须弥顶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20495,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其二","author":"释道印","text":"五五二十五，击碎虚空鼓。\n大地不容针，十方无寸土。\n春生夏长复何云，甜者甜兮苦者苦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20496,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其一","author":"释道印","text":"大雄山下虎，南山鳖鼻蛇。\n等闲撞著，抱赏归家。\n若也不惜好手，便与拔出重牙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20497,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧归华藏","author":"释道宁","text":"禅人告别欲南归，卷衲和云伴锡飞。\n脚下路穿华藏界，何须待叩吉祥机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20498,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其十一","author":"释道宁","text":"妙体本如如，无劳待卷舒。\n直饶恁么去，未免草庵居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20499,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其十六","author":"释道宁","text":"诸佛非道父非亲，格外殷勤强指陈。\n朕兆未分全体露，不知谁识个中人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20500,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其三","author":"释道宁","text":"一片虚空亘古今，鳞龙头角竞疏亲。\n坐亡立脱知多少，铁树花开别是春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20501,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其十三","author":"释道宁","text":"煎茶扫地事如麻，若了如麻理不差。\n打破画瓶归去后，始知凡圣眼中花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20502,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其十七","author":"释道宁","text":"法王严父是真依，二臂三头转背伊。\n要会祖师端的旨，不劳瞬目又扬眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20503,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其六","author":"释道宁","text":"游山玩水事寻常，早晚归来鬓欲霜。\n踏破草鞋回首看，数声猿叫白云乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20504,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其二","author":"释道宁","text":"抹粉涂坯恰似呆，神头鬼面舞三台。\n千千万万人窥看，子细不知谁见来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20505,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其九","author":"释道宁","text":"非风幡动唯心动，犹涉廉纤强指陈。\n大地未曾添寸土，不知谁是点头人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20506,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其七","author":"释道宁","text":"风头坐断进还难，衲子相将不易看。\n不到潼关天已晓，不堪回首望长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20507,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其八","author":"释道宁","text":"丛林乍入问来由，吃粥无过洗钵休。\n有意气时添意气，不风流处也风流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20508,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其十二","author":"释道宁","text":"思量有个悟因由，万叠云山障路头。\n更话煎茶并扫地，泥中洗土转添愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20509,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其十","author":"释道宁","text":"火号更深喝道来，普门关棙一时开。\n圆通大师呵呵笑，不是峨嵋与五台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20510,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其一","author":"释道宁","text":"前箭犹轻后箭深，行人何事苦沉吟。\n翻身若解看方便，始信真鍮不博金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20511,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十九首 其六十六","author":"释道宁","text":"长老未离方丈里，鼓声先为剖圆音。\n眼闻耳见非他事，何必驱驰向外寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20512,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十九首 其三十六","author":"释道宁","text":"选得幽居惬野情，终年无送复无迎。\n有时直上孤峰顶，月下披云啸一声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20513,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十九首 其三十五","author":"释道宁","text":"焚香提起经来读，便是拈华付嘱心。\n此外别求玄妙解，悠悠千古少知音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20514,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十九首 其二十七","author":"释道宁","text":"阴云弥四野，心地长尘埃。\n试请回光看，生从何处来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20515,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十九首 其十六","author":"释道宁","text":"闻声不悟道，见色岂明心。\n大冶红炉里，真鍮不博金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20516,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十九首 其四","author":"释道宁","text":"数声归笛离春浦，一片孤帆过洞津。\n到岸舍舟常式事，何须更问渡头人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20517,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十三首 其四十二","author":"释道宁","text":"诸佛放光明，助发实相义。\n言下合无生，为祥复为瑞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20518,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十三首 其四十一","author":"释道宁","text":"薄?明月碎清风，浅种深耕莫大功。\n破二作三横竖算，四方八面用无穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20519,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十三首 其十八","author":"释道宁","text":"暗里抽横骨，明中坐舌头。\n偏圆不到处，万古及千秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20520,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十三首 其六","author":"释道宁","text":"南北东西万万千，赵州待客岂徒然。\n莫嫌冷淡无滋味，惯把脂麻一例煎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20521,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十三首 其四","author":"释道宁","text":"等閒垂手去，八面清风生。\n大悲不展手，通身是眼睛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20522,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄希饶閒堂","author":"释道宁","text":"浮名浮利懒跻攀，闻搆茆堂杳霭间。\n搔首凭栏人不会，落花啼鸟藓痕斑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20523,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十六夜对月和十五夜无月","author":"释道宁","text":"四面阴云旋旋舒，冰轮一片耀昏衢。\n影分万派曾无异，光照千门岂有殊。\n境寂风清思至友，香残玉篆倦加趺。\n寥寥廓彻琉璃界，心月圆明德不孤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20524,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新笋竹","author":"释道宁","text":"迸破莓苔地，亭亭出短篱。\n箨随风雨解，根有岁寒期。\n凤管终须奏，渔竿莫可窥。\n傥容常守节，定见化龙时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20525,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其十四","author":"释道宁","text":"工巧诸伎艺，头头迸出真祥瑞。\n瞥然端坐到家乡，堪笑维摩谈不二。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20526,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其四","author":"释道宁","text":"春去复春来，桃花依旧开。\n东风浩浩曾无间，刚地灵云道不猜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20527,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其五","author":"释道宁","text":"百炼精金大冶中，任他腾焰亘大红。\n须臾拈出教人看，添得行家价转丰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20528,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其十五","author":"释道宁","text":"尽现行此事，一段光明照天地。\n体用从来非自他，何须更觅锥头利。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20529,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十九首 其六十八","author":"释道宁","text":"行脚高士，拨草瞻风。\n未透目前关，难明心地印。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20530,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十九首 其六十七","author":"释道宁","text":"灵山瞬目，早是周遮。\n良马窥鞭，岂为英俊。\n岩间宴坐，天帝散花。\n无说无闻，藏头露影。\n少林面壁，计较未成。\n立雪断肱，辜他衲子。\n黄梅呈颂，胜负偏枯。\n半夜传衣，瞒人不少。\n从上来事，合作么生。\n岂假人天众前摇唇鼓舌，竞锐争锋。\n互立主宾，交参问答。\n检点将来，弥天过犯。\n不因檀信方敲唱，争见龙华会里人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20531,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十九首 其六十五","author":"释道宁","text":"摩竭正令，未免崎岖。\n少室垂慈，早伤风骨。\n腰囊挈锡，辜负平生。\n炼行灰心，递相钝致。\n争似春雨晴，春山青。\n白云三片五片，黄鸟一声两声。\n千眼大悲看不足，王维虽巧画难成。\n直饶便恁么，犹是涉途程。\n人从卞州来，不得东京信。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20532,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十九首 其六十四","author":"释道宁","text":"千尺丝纶直下浮，芦湾深处浪花粗。\n捞虾樚蚬无心恋，还有金鳞上钓无。\n摇头摆尾，跃浪冲波。\n不顾丝纶，便请吞钩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20533,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十九首 其六十三","author":"释道宁","text":"报慈一隔，佛祖命脉。\n放去收来，圣凡罔测。\n隔不隔，若为陈。\n担取诗书归旧隐，野花啼鸟一般春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20534,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈六十九首 其六十二","author":"释道宁","text":"历历分明，堂堂显露。\n师子翻身，象王回顾。\n若能这里会观瞻，瞥转玄关无别事。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20535,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]